# LLM-Assisted Text Classification via Majority Voting (English + Arabic)

Zero-shot classification with GPT-4 using a minimal **majority-vote** baseline.
Datasets: **AG News**, **DBpedia-14**, **GoEmotions**, **LABR (Arabic)**. Includes **abstention** and **early stopping**.

## Quickstart
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
export OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
python -m scripts.eval_dataset --dataset ag_news --k 5 --model gpt-4o --max-samples 200
```

## LABR note
Place `data/labr_binary_test.csv` with columns `text,label` (labels: Positive/Negative).
